      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. but u said i should be prepared to defend why one \"ultimately serves human flourishing better.\" that's a bit vague though. can u actually dive deeper into the libertarian side? like, what are the specific philosophical justifications they use for why property rights should be absolute? i don't want to just say \"they hate taxes,\" i need the actual logic behind it.",
